View ViewTablePRODUCTFOROFFER 'Produits pour offre (/*IDSUPPLIER*/)' 'Produits pour offre (/*IDSUPPLIER*/)'  255 255 255 _ 0 0 0 0 5 5 5 5 '[TRACELEVEL=(/*TRACELEVEL*/);TRACEFILE=;TOOLBAR=0;FLIPVERTICALLY=0;FLIPHORIZONTALLY=0;NATURESCALE=0;BESTFIT=1;SCROLLBAR=1;SHOWNAME=1;ZOOMOBJECT=;CURRENTPAGE=1;CLOSEEVENT=0;BKGROUNDCOLOR=(255 255 255);SCREENCOLOR=(255 255 255);PATHLINEWIDTH=9;PATHLINECOLOR=(0 0 0);PATHARROWWIDTH=15;PATHARROWCOLOR=(255 0 0);POEMSERVER=;MAPLOGFILE=;MATRIXCRITERION=Distance;MATRIXCOMPUTERADIUS=0.5;SPEEDKMHOUR=50;STRAIGHTDISTANCERATIO=1.4;SITEINTRADISTANCE=;MATRIXMAXCOMPUTEWIDTH=;NEIGHBOURHOOD=;MATRIXFILENAME=;MATRIXDIRECTORY=;GLOBALVARIABLE=0]'

Table tablePRODUCTFOROFFER _ _ 0 0 2000 500 \
"[]" - \
"[TITLE=Produits pour offre (/*IDSUPPLIER*/);FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=10;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;LINESEPARATOR=\n;HEIGHT=30;BORDER=0;]"\
"[FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=9;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;]" \
"[FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=8;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;]" \
"[MARGIN=(10 0 10 0);FONTCOLOR=(0 0 0);FONTSIZE=9;FONTNAME=Times New Roman;] \
COLUMNFILL={(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255),(255 255 255)};\
ALIGNTEXT={Left,Left,Left,Right,Right,Right,Right,Right,Right,Right,Center,Center,Center,Left}]"\
"[DATAOBJ=PRODUCTFOROFFER;FILLCOLOR=LINERGB]"

Data PRODUCTFOROFFER 'Produits pour offre (/*IDSUPPLIER*/)' PRODUCTFOROFFER HTTPSQL 0 '[FIND={IDPRODUCT,FAMILY,DESIGNATION,QUANTITYPACKAGE,QUANTITYSTOCK,quantityORDERED,quantitySUPPLIED,MINQUANTITY,PRICE,TRANSPORTCOST,TRANSPORTTIME,DATEOFFER,DATEVALIDITY,COMMENTS}]'   [DOUBLECLICK=] \
"[14;(string,IDPRODUCT,Produit,,10,,);(string,FAMILY,Famille,,10,,);(string,DESIGNATION,Désignation,,15,,);(float,QUANTITYPACKAGE,Qté paquet,,13,,);(float,QUANTITYSTOCK,Qté stock,,12,,);(float,quantityORDERED,Qté commande,,18,,);(float,quantitySUPPLIED,Qté provision,,18,,);(int,MINQUANTITY,Min quantité,,15,,);(float,PRICE,Prix unitaire,,15,,);(float,TRANSPORTCOST,Frais transport,,18,,);(string,TRANSPORTTIME,Temps transport,,19,,);(date,DATEOFFER,Date offre,,15,,YYYY-MM-DD|DD/MM/YYYY);(date,DATEVALIDITY,Date validation,,18,,YYYY-MM-DD|DD/MM/YYYY);(string,COMMENTS,Commentaire,,18,,);(float,MYPRICE,Prix Catalogue,,10.4.80,0);\
(color,LINERGB,(255 255 255),,13.0.0)]"\
"SERVER=(/*SERVERIP*/);PORT=(/*SERVERPORT*/);QUERY=SELECT a.Id as IDPRODUCT,\
		 a.Designation as DESIGNATION,\
		 a.Family as FAMILY,\
		 a.QuantityPackaging as QUANTITYPACKAGE,\
		 a.QuantityStock as QUANTITYSTOCK,\
		 IIF(a.QuantitySupplied is NULL, 0, a.QuantitySupplied) as QUANTITYSUPPLIED,\
		 a.QuantityOrdered as QUANTITYORDERED,\
		 a.PriceUnit as MYPRICE,\
		 a.Weight as WEIGHTUNIT,\
		 format(a.Weight*a.QuantityPackaging,'0.0') as WEIGHTPACKAGE,\
		 ' ' as MINQUANTITY,\
		 ' ' as PRICE,\
		 ' ' AS TRANSPORTCOST,\
		 ' ' AS TRANSPORTTIME,\
		 ' ' as DATEOFFER,\
		 ' ' as DATEVALIDITY,\
		 ' ' as COMMENTS,\
		 0 as INORDER,\
		 '(255 255 255)' AS LINERGB \
		 FROM PRODUCT a \
		 WHERE ( a.Family in ((/*FAMILY*/)) or 'XXX' in ((/*FAMILY*/))) \
		 and a.TypeProduct<>'F'\
		 and a.Id not in (select os.IdProduct from OFFER_PRODUCT os where os.IdSupplier in ((/*IDSUPPLIER*/)) ) \
		 UNION ALL \
		 SELECT \
		  a.Id as IDPRODUCT,\
		  a.Designation as DESIGNATION,\
		  a.Family as FAMILY,\
		  a.QuantityPackaging as QUANTITYPACKAGE,\
		  a.QuantityStock as QUANTITYSTOCK,\
		 IIF(a.QuantitySupplied is NULL , 0 , a.QuantitySupplied) as QUANTITYSUPPLIED,\
		 a.QuantityOrdered as QUANTITYORDERED,\
		  a.PriceUnit as MYPRICE,\
		  a.Weight as WEIGHTUNIT,\
		  format(a.Weight*a.QuantityPackaging,'0.0') as WEIGHTPACKAGE,\
		 format(os.MinQuantity,'0') as MINQUANTITY,\
		 os.PriceUnit as PRICE,\
		  format(os.TransportCost,'0.00') AS TRANSPORTCOST,\
		  format(os.TransportTime,'0') AS TRANSPORTTIME,\
		  os.DateOffer as DATEOFFER,\
		  os.DateValidity as DATEVALIDITY,\
		  os.Comments as COMMENTS,\
		  1 as INORDER,\
		 '(150 150 255)' AS LINERGB \
		 FROM PRODUCT a \
		  inner join OFFER_PRODUCT os on os.IdProduct=a.Id \
		 WHERE ( a.Family in ((/*FAMILY*/)) or 'XXX' in ((/*FAMILY*/)) )\
		  and (os.IdSupplier in ((/*IDSUPPLIER*/)) ) \
		 Order BY INORDER desc, IDPRODUCT, Family, DESIGNATION "


Script AddProductToOffer  'Quantité + un paquet' _ 61 'Quantité + un paquet' _ 'tablePRODUCTFOROFFER' '( 0 0 0 0 )' '[0,(0 0 0),(255 255 255);;Arial,,-20;(C M),(2 2 2 2)]' _ _  '[SINGLESEL=0;COUNT=2;NETNCL=HTTP;SERVER=(/*SERVERIP*/);PORT=(/*SERVERPORT*/);MESSAGE=0;CANCEL=0;SKIP=0;WAITCURSOR=0;]' \
Ncl '(/*SERVERDIRECTORY*/)' '(/*SERVERDIRECTORY*/)Model\Interaction\Edit\Supply\AddProductToOfferSupplier.n' '(/*SERVERDIRECTORY*/)ncl.cfg' _ _ _ 1 \
 '(/*SERVERPORT*/) (/*USERID*/)  {/*Selected(tablePRODUCTFOROFFER;1;(string,IDPRODUCT);)*/} \
 (/*IDSUPPLIER*/) (/*IDOFFER*/) \
'\
Reload _ _ _

// 2. Remove Product from offer
Script RemoveProduct  'Enlever produit' _ 62 'Enlever produit' _ 'tablePRODUCTFOROFFER' '( 0 0 0 0 )' '[0,(0 0 0),(255 255 255);;Arial,,-20;(C M),(2 2 2 2)]' _ _  '[SINGLESEL=0;COUNT=2;NETNCL=HTTP;SERVER=(/*SERVERIP*/);PORT=(/*SERVERPORT*/);MESSAGE=0;CANCEL=0;SKIP=0;WAITCURSOR=0;]' \
Ncl '(/*SERVERDIRECTORY*/)' '(/*SERVERDIRECTORY*/)Model\Interaction\Edit\Supply\RemoveProductFromOffer.n' '(/*SERVERDIRECTORY*/)ncl.cfg' _ _ _ 1 \
 '(/*SERVERPORT*/) (/*USERID*/)  {/*Selected(tablePRODUCTFOROFFER;1;(string,IDPRODUCT);)*/} \
 (/*IDSUPPLIER*/) (/*IDOFFER*/) \
'\
Reload _ _ _

